{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3183230/extras/en_steam_title_01.png?t=1750326483\" /></div></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Dream Strikers</strong> is a <strong>stylish 3D action fighting game</strong> that\u2019s easy to pick up yet deep to master. Featuring high-mobility combat and flashy combo effects, players can choose their side and battle across cyber-fantasy arenas where dodging and chaining attacks combine into intense combat moments. Whether in solo arcade challenges or local 1v1 battles, each match delivers fast-paced, accessible action. Every fight is a clash of conviction and obsession.<strong></strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3183230/extras/en_steam_title_2.png?t=1750326483\" /></div></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3183230/extras/ezgif-3cff8260704b87.gif?t=1750326483\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The game boasts stunning visual performance\u2014from dynamic facial animations and combat lighting effects to intricate scene details, all designed to deliver realism and impact. With high-end rendering, every battle feels like a cinematic experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3183230/extras/\u5716\u72471.gif?t=1750326483\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3183230/extras/en_steam_title_06.png?t=1750326483\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3183230/extras/camera.gif?t=1750326483\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Unlike traditional fighters, <strong>Dream Strikers</strong> features a dual camera system that dynamically switches between 2D and 3D perspectives, preserving combo freedom while highlighting movement and action detail.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3183230/extras/en_steam_title_04.png?t=1750326483\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3183230/extras/ezgif-792d868dc3ddca.gif?t=1750326483\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">When the moment is right, unleash your power with <strong>Ultimate Finishers</strong>\u2014high-impact cinematic attacks that can turn the tide in an instant.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3183230/extras/en_steam_title_03.png?t=1750326483\" /></div></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3183230/extras/\u81ea\u7531\u9023\u6bb5.gif?t=1750326483\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The combat system <strong>encourages players to freely combine skills based on the flow of battle</strong>, allowing for unique styles and strategies. Whether you\u2019re a beginner or a seasoned player, there\u2019s depth to explore, and each character brings distinct mechanics to the battlefield.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3183230/extras/en_steam_title_05.png?t=1750326483\" /></div><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3183230/extras/\u5716\u72475.gif?t=1750326483\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">With a diverse cast of characters, each with unique stories and fighting styles, players will experience a world full of challenges and emotion. As the narrative unfolds, uncover hidden truths and confront the nightmares that lurk in the dark.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Game Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Local 1v1 multiplayer for head-to-head matches.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Solo arcade mode with custom-designed AI challenges.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">4 playable characters with distinct moves and stories.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">8 immersive dream-themed battle stages including skies, ruins, and cyber cities.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Fast-paced mobility combat and cinematic finishing moves in every match.</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3183230?t=1750326483","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3183230?t=1750326483","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3183230/9fdf3168f98a7cb6803a5509e2df859a1c720e2c/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1750326483","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3183230/9fdf3168f98a7cb6803a5509e2df859a1c720e2c/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1750326483","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"LAN PvP","id":47},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen PvP","id":37},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen","id":24},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{