hanics to the battlefield.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3183230/extras/en_steam_title_05.png?t=1750326483\" /></div><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3183230/extras/\u5716\u72475.gif?t=1750326483\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">With a diverse cast of characters, each with unique stories and fighting styles, players will experience a world full of challenges and emotion. As the narrative unfolds, uncover hidden truths and confront the nightmares that lurk in the dark.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Game Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Local 1v1 multiplayer for head-to-head matches.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Solo arcade mode with custom-designed AI challenges.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">4 playable characters with distinct moves and stories.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">8 immersive dream-themed battle stages including skies, ruins, and cyber cities.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Fast-paced mobility combat and cinematic finishing moves in every match.</p></li></ul>","developers":["Burn Out Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3183230/header.jpg?t=1750326483","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257110947,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.stea